<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Abhijit Sinha (ARN-367596)"
  description="How Abhijit Sinha, AMFI-registered Mutual Fund Distributor, collects, uses, stores, and protects your personal and financial details."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 sm:py-20 prose prose-slate prose-sm sm:prose-base">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <h2>1. Introduction and Scope</h2>
    <p>This Privacy Policy outlines how Abhijit Sinha, an AMFI-registered Mutual Fund Distributor (ARN-367596), collects, uses, stores, and protects your personal and financial details. When you use this website (abhijitsinha.in), submit contact forms, or schedule consultations, you agree to the data practices described on this page.</p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect only the information required to assess investment suitability, schedule meetings, and facilitate mutual fund transactions:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact Data:</strong> Full name, email address, phone number, and city of residence.</li>
      <li><strong>Financial Profile & Goals:</strong> Investment horizons, target asset brackets, risk preferences, and existing SIP records shared during consultations.</li>
      <li><strong>KYC & Regulatory Information:</strong> PAN, date of birth, bank account details, and address proofs required strictly during transaction onboarding.</li>
      <li><strong>Technical Logs:</strong> Basic server logs such as browser type, device operating system, and IP address collected automatically to ensure website security.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Purpose and Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Evaluating investment suitability before initiating mutual fund applications.</li>
      <li>Coordinating 1:1 exploratory meetings and responding to inbound service requests.</li>
      <li>Facilitating investor onboarding and transaction routing through SEBI-registered RTAs (CAMS/KFintech) and AMCs.</li>
      <li>Fulfilling statutory record-keeping mandates required by SEBI and AMFI.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Information Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
    <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties for commercial marketing. Your details are shared strictly under the following conditions:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Authorized Infrastructure Entities:</strong> SEBI-registered AMCs, RTAs (CAMS/KFintech), payment gateways, and transaction platforms (such as BSE StAR MF or NSE NMF II) to execute investment instructions.</li>
      <li><strong>Legal & Regulatory Obligations:</strong> Statutory bodies, law enforcement agencies, or tax authorities when mandated by applicable Indian laws or regulatory directives.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Data Storage and Security</h2>
    <p>We implement technical safeguards to prevent unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure of your information. Digital records are stored on access-controlled systems. You must recognize that no digital transmission over the internet offers absolute security.</p>

    <h2>6. Your Data Rights</h2>
    <p>Subject to mandatory statutory retention requirements under Indian financial regulations, you maintain the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Request a copy of the personal information stored in our records.</li>
      <li>Request corrections to inaccurate, incomplete, or outdated personal information.</li>
      <li>Withdraw consent for ongoing non-regulatory email communications.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For data privacy inquiries, email <a href="mailto:compliance@abhijitsinha.in">compliance@abhijitsinha.in</a>.</p>
  </article>
